{"id":"35774","texts":[{"kind":"transcription","label":"תעתיק","editor":"umrethwala","citation":"Yusuf Umrethwala, unpublished editions (n.p., 2022).","html":"<section dir=\"rtl\"> <div data-canvas=\"https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/35774/iiif/textblock/35642/canvas/2/\"> <ol>\n<li>\n<p>و حفظ سائبة ولا زالت</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>وموافقة ولا مواقفة</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>من الادعية الصالحة له والشا……</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>الفاضل الاجل الاسعد</p>\n</li>\n</ol> </div> </section>"}]}